type: software
title: "k11 Performance QA MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server and CI tool for load and performance testing as release evidence: API functional test flows reused as load scenarios, per-endpoint latency percentiles, error rates and throughput, SLO checks, and regressions against a baseline that require a tolerance, a minimum delta and statistical significance (Mann-Whitney U), with k6 or a builtin engine and guardrails that keep load away from production."
